config PPK2_TRACE
	bool "PPK2 trace markers"
	depends on GPIO
	help
	  GPIO markers (ppk2_trace.h) wired to the digital inputs D0..D7 of
	  a PPK2, to tell which code a current was drawn by. The pins come
	  from the zephyr,user devicetree properties ppk2-d0-gpios to
	  ppk2-d7-gpios. When disabled, the markers compile to nothing.
